---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Selected Publications
description: "Publications by Vasanth Sarathy — AI reasoning, evaluation, argumentation, cognitive security, NLP, and robotics"
permalink: /publications/
---

<p>
  More than 40 peer-reviewed publications across AI, NLP, cognitive science, and robotics venues,
  organized around one question: <a href="/research/">can AI reasoning be trusted &mdash; and how do
  we establish it?</a> Below is a selection; the complete record &mdash; including workshop papers,
  preprints, and earlier work &mdash; is on
  <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user={{ site.scholar }}">Google Scholar</a>.
</p>

<div class="publications">
  {% for year in publications.years %}
  <div class="year-group">
    <h2 class="year-heading">{{ year }}</h2>

    {% for pub in publications.byYear[year] %}
    <div class="publication">
      <div class="publication-title">
        {% if pub.link %}<a href="{{ pub.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ pub.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ pub.title }}{% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="publication-authors">
        {{ pub.author }}
      </div>

      <div class="publication-venue">
        {% if pub.abbr %}<strong>{{ pub.abbr }}</strong>{% if pub.venue != pub.abbr %} &mdash; {{ pub.venue }}{% endif %}{% else %}{{ pub.venue }}{% endif %}{% if pub.tag %} <span class="publication-tag">({{ pub.tag }})</span>{% endif %}{% if pub.note %} <span class="publication-note">&middot; {{ pub.note }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="year-group">
    <h2 class="year-heading">Patent</h2>
    <div class="publication">
      <div class="publication-title">
        <a href="{{ publications.patent.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ publications.patent.title }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="publication-authors">{{ publications.patent.author }}</div>
      <div class="publication-venue">{{ publications.patent.venue }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
